<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00213/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块黑板擦，任何被项目所接触的字迹都会变得无法被擦除<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市███初级中学<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这是和那块黑板配套的吗？</em>——特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00213" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00213" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00213-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607975066" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589957654 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 May 2020 06:54</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00126/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>十（10）个有自我意识的██高小人，实验表明项目的智力约等于一名高中学历的成年人。项目会在自身附近寻找██高积木，并会试图使用这些积木制造一些东西，比如：房屋，车辆等。且项目制造的交通工具可以以未知方式驱动。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> 上海市中一██高积木专卖店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于一标准人形收容间<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我认为应该对这类高智力异常进行重视</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目建造的房屋每30小时会以未知方式产生一名新的项目个体。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录2</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目个体数量已到达100个</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录3</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室内形成了一个社会群体，并且群体规模还在增大</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;关闭记录4</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>经过观察，发现项目个体在超过200个时，每三天会有一名个体“死亡”，其余的个体会将同伴的“尸体”放入房屋中，30分钟后，房屋中的“尸体”会以未知方式随机转化为3个积木块。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;更新记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-关闭记录5</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目在收容室中建造了一座城市，其外观与██市完全一致</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00126" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00126" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00126-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607975066" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588077877 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Apr 2020 12:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>由██国产的一部华█手机。当有非该国国籍的人手持该项目，并以夸张的表情和语气说出夸赞有关该国的话时，该项目会变成一部iP█one手机。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一名俄罗斯籍男子手中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存于Site-CN-57中的一个低危异常储存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我一直支持国产！嘿！S█ri，我的█文好吗？——Fula████</p>
